cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MOAD.jl in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MOAD.jl: Many-body Operators, Algebra, and Dynamics"
abstract: >-
  MOAD.jl is a Julia framework for many-body operator algebra,
  Hilbert-space construction, exact diagonalization, dynamical
  correlation functions, and core-level spectroscopies (XAS, RIXS,
  fluorescence yield) on lattice and atomic multiplet problems.
authors:
